From 58f21ce5a24be605c09502641fec90350b0b5e72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 11:41:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(fdm): Batch 4 European Black-Scholes FD vertical (#635)

Port FdmSolverDesc, Fdm1DimSolver, FdmBlackScholesSolver, and
FdBlackScholesVanillaEngine for the plain European / no-dividend path.
Oracles cover testFdEngines (value/delta/gamma/theta tolerances) and the
Douglas + ImplicitEuler arms of testPDESchemes. Local-vol, quanto,
dividends, American/Bermudan, and unported schemes stay deferred to #636.
